-------------------------------------------------------------
-Direction: Device -> App
-Characteristic: 0002
-Type: NOTIFY
-Length: 6 bytes
-
-Offset  Size  Field
-0       1     0xA4
-1       2     Session
-3       1     Status
-4       2     Detail
-
