-
-- B1 Notify failure
-- Curve Notify failure
-- Curve Send timeout
-- ACK timeout
-- A4 Status timeout
-- 未知/錯誤 Control command
-
-V1.15 已移除待機 Deep-sleep；待機不會因時間到而停止 BLE。低電保護仍可停用 BLE。
-
-
-18. Firmware Version API
-------------------------------------------------------------
-UUID:
-7f510004-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
-
-Property:
-READ
-
-Response:
-V1.15
-
-
-19. Diagnostic API
-------------------------------------------------------------
-UUID:
-7f510005-1b15-4d5f-9f4d-9b3c7a1d9a10
-
-Property:
-READ
-
-Length:
-20 bytes
-
-Offset  Size  Field
-0       1     Protocol Version (=4)
-1       1     TX State
-2       1     Flags
-3       1     Reliable Mode
-4       2     Current Result Session
-6       2     Sample Count
-8       4     CRC32
-12      2     Duration ms
-14      2     Command Errors
-16      2     Notify Failures
-18      2     ACK Timeouts
-
-TX State:
-0 = IDLE
-1 = START
-2 = DATA
-3 = END
-4 = WAIT_ACK
-5 = DONE
-6 = TIMEOUT
-
-
-20. App Connection Flow
-------------------------------------------------------------
-1. Scan BRD_XXXX
-2. Connect
-3. Discover Service 0001
-4. Subscribe 0002 Notification
-5. Read 0004 Firmware Revision
-6. 等待 B1 LIVE
-7. 每收到 B1 直接更新 State / Flags / RPM UI
-
-不需要：
-- Subscribe 0006
-- 解析 0x81 STATE
-- 回 C5 ACK
-- 保存 state_seq
-
-
-21. App Measurement Flow
-------------------------------------------------------------
-Connect
--> Subscribe 0002
--> B1 WAIT_LOAD every 200 ms
-
-LOAD
--> B1 LOADED_READY every 200 ms
-
-Spin
--> B1 SPINNING_LOADED every 200 ms
-
-Launch
--> B2 LAUNCH once
--> B1 SPINNING_LAUNCHED every 200 ms
-
-Finish
--> B1 RESULT_PENDING every 200 ms
--> A1
--> A2...
--> A3
--> App validation
--> C1 / C2 / C3 / C4 as required
--> A4 STATUS
-
-
-22. Protocol Summary
-------------------------------------------------------------
-Protocol Name:
-BRD Reliable BLE Protocol V4
-
-Firmware:
-BRD_BLE_OLED V1.15
-
-State Sync:
-B1 LIVE periodic snapshot, 200 ms
-
-Legacy 0x81 STATE:
-Removed
-
-C5 STATE_ACK:
-Removed
-
-state_seq:
-Removed
-
-Reliable Curve:
-A1/A2/A3/A4 + C1/C2/C3/C4 retained
